{"id":265934,"name":"803 Triple Standard Room, PGS","headline":" Pyramids Global Suites -  Triple Standard Room","summary":"Welcome to Pyramids Lofts, your private view of the timeless Giza Pyramids. Soak in the beauty of the pyramids by day, then unwind in your amazing rooftop access by night.","description":{"Space":"\n\r\nThis bright and cozy loft is designed for relaxation and comfort  the perfect retreat after a day spent exploring the pyramids and the vibrant streets of Giza.\r\nInside, you’ll find:\r\n\r\n✔️ Three single beds with hotel-quality Egyptian cotton linens\r\n✔️ A bathroom stocked with fresh face and body towels\r\n✔️ A mini bar fridge with a Complimentary bottled water\r\n✔️ Free Wi-Fi, Cable TV\r\n✔️ A Kettle machine\r\n\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\n✔️Guests will have full private access to the Studio and all of its amenities during their stay.\r\n✔️Free Access to our amazing rooftop while food and beverage with extra fees.\r\n✔️For larger groups or multiple bookings, feel free to contact us — we may have additional units available in the same building or nearby.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\n✔️We’re available to assist you between 9:00 AM and 4:00 AM Cairo time.\r\n✔️Whether you have questions before arrival or need help during your stay, our team is happy to support you on via Airbnb messages throughout your experience.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Safety & Accessibility\r\nDespite the humble setting, the area is generally safe and the location provides unbeatable access to the Giza Pyramids.\r\n✔️ Authentic Local Surroundings\r\nThe apartment is well-maintained and just as shown in the photos, but the neighborhood offers a modest, authentic experience. Streets may be dusty, unpaved, or littered, common in areas around the Pyramids. If you’re seeking polished or luxury surroundings outside the apartment, this may not be the right fit.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Location: Just a short walk to the Giza Pyramids main gate — perfect for sightseeing.\r\n✔️ Transportation: Uber, In-drive, and local taxis are easily available 24/7.\r\n✔️ Private Services:\r\nWe offer convenient airport pickup, drop-off, and private guided tours across Cairo and Giza. Just message us to arrange in advance.\r\n⚠️ Parking is not provided. Guests may use nearby street or private parking (subject to availability).\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\n⚠️\r\n• Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the apartment. Outdoor smoking only. A $100 fine applies for violations.\r\n• Only registered guests are allowed inside the unit. No unapproved visitors.\r\n• Proof of marriage is required for Egyptian and Arab nationals.\r\n• IDs (Egyptian citizens only) or passport copies for all guests must be submitted before check-in.\r\n• Please respect neighbors and shared spaces at all times.\r\n✔️We kindly ask that you treat the space with care and leave it tidy at check-out."},"city":"Giza","capacity_of_guests":3,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":3,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":4,"location_address1":"5 King Faisal St, Kafr Nassar, Al Haram, Giza Governorate 3524020","location_address2":"","location_lat":"29.9905128","location_lng":"31.1361443","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"loft","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":10,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":511676,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 100 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \